# Line endings are a repo policy, not a per-machine one. Without this file, the
# working-tree line endings depend on each developer's local `core.autocrlf`, which
# differs between Windows and macOS/Linux installs and produces whole-file diffs.
#
# `eol=lf` forces LF in the working tree on every platform, matching .editorconfig
# (`end_of_line = lf`) and Prettier. Do not remove without changing all three.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary

# Generated; collapse in diffs and reviews.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
